------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Method:      .getSpoolComponents()
--
-- Description: Get the components of the currently enhanced spool
--
-- Method Type: Function/Procedure
--
-- Arguments:
--   [#] [R/RW] [Data Type] [Description]
